  <p>[ <a class="reference internal" href="../index.html#cli-aws"><span class="std std-ref">aws</span></a> . <a class="reference internal" href="index.html#cli-aws-iam"><span class="std std-ref">iam</span></a> ]</p>
<div class="section" id="create-role">
<span id="cli-aws-iam-create-role"></span><h1>create-role<a class="headerlink" href="#create-role" title="Permalink to this heading">¶</a></h1>
<div class="section" id="description">
<h2>Description<a class="headerlink" href="#description" title="Permalink to this heading">¶</a></h2>
<p>Creates a new role for your Amazon Web Services account.</p>
<p>For more information about roles, see <a class="reference external" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_roles.html">IAM roles</a> in the <em>IAM User Guide</em> . For information about quotas for role names and the number of roles you can create, see <a class="reference external" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/UserGuide/reference_iam-quotas.html">IAM and STS quotas</a> in the <em>IAM User Guide</em> .</p>
<p>See also: <a class="reference external" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/goto/WebAPI/iam-2010-05-08/CreateRole">AWS API Documentation</a></p>
</div>
<div class="section" id="synopsis">
<h2>Synopsis<a class="headerlink" href="#synopsis" title="Permalink to this heading">¶</a></h2>
